					"content": "Thank you, kind friend.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						752710502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ziki"
				},
				{
					"id": 752710502,
					"content": "Has Ziki been causing you trouble? His thought process can be a little unconventional, but that's what I like about him.",
